{"version":1,"key":"card:446","content":{"id":446,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"58493f0f-0242-444b-86c3-39f206057d0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"clear"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 删除所有的字典项，原地执行，无返回值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"c9bea259-f37e-4ec5-9c7f-438d9295a8d3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1bbfa500-0929-4ea9-9890-b9ced0acfb2e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d['name'] = 'Gumby'\n>>> d['age'] = 42\n>>> d\n{'age': 42, 'name': 'Gumby'}\n>>> returned_value = d.clear()\n>>> d\n{}\n>>> print(returned_value)\nNone","collabId":"8a30a6de-d663-4cbc-82ff-158094807a86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03261c70-6caa-4512-a22c-41d586f67df1","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"copy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个新字典，其包含的键-值对与原来的字典相同（这个方法执行的是浅复制）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"86db3640-9925-4fba-b79c-fceb4d8e0452","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"233c7900-9921-4533-a467-3b6d59e0f217","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> x = {'username': 'admin', 'machines': ['foo', 'bar', 'baz']}\n>>> y = x.copy()\n>>> y['username'] = 'mlh'\n>>> y['machines'].remove('bar')\n>>> y\n{'username': 'mlh', 'machines': ['foo', 'baz']}\n>>> x\n{'username': 'admin', 'machines': ['foo', 'baz']}","collabId":"c25b4118-fe85-40cf-9281-e4e93402f8e8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac3ddc07-37c0-4f16-9ad4-21d64b777e12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"深复制可使用模块 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"copy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"deepcopy"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"5c78c7d8-1cc5-4bd7-afd7-a45042c601e8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9a0f90e3-c5a2-4a73-bd40-246480d39a79","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> from copy import deepcopy\n>>> d = {}\n>>> d['names'] = ['Alfred', 'Bertrand']\n>>> c = d.copy()\n>>> dc = deepcopy(d)\n>>> d['names'].append('Clive')\n>>> c\n{'names': ['Alfred', 'Bertrand', 'Clive']}\n>>> dc\n{'names': ['Alfred', 'Bertrand']}","collabId":"67b30827-7996-4f54-913d-6bea0f128a00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af33ff00-bd85-4db9-b0f9-cb9849023918","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fromkeys"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个新字典，其中包含指定的键，且每个键对应的值都是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"24695610-5206-4d86-8c33-069bea5cbf56","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9e43036f-8f6b-40c6-bd98-b52dfb727db8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> {}.fromkeys(['name', 'age'])\n{'age': None, 'name': None}","collabId":"6a835ac6-db4c-4521-a3d0-7f5491891200","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"446eb0f2-3c94-4644-b75a-74a1d9f2234c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不想使用默认值 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可提供特定的值。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"0f83d68c-f0e1-40c6-ba0d-45b26b32ae5e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2b94a787-8fa1-45e7-b805-f7e363cfdf82","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> dict.fromkeys(['name', 'age'], '(unknown)')\n{'age': '(unknown)', 'name': '(unknown)'}","collabId":"75c26053-efda-48bb-bc74-3644a4bb0ca5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13036290-078c-4ada-b0da-4685195c7474","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为访问字典项提供了宽松的环境。通常，如果你试图访问字典中没有的项，将引发错误。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"71cf52d7-54e9-4d4e-8287-904c4547a241","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"66ef4b3a-6cfb-41ee-b2c5-fa9c6581aa4a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> print(d['name'])\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in ?\nKeyError: 'name'","collabId":"fd38d2fb-c7af-4ad8-8a43-0731bc38282f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a16fbcb5-7719-49bf-aa66-22bb2fa41c60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来访问不存在的键时，没有引发异常，而是返回 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。你可指定“默认”值，这样将返回你指定的值而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"8384f9cc-8ab0-4009-9d18-1e15b09e9efb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0982a1cd-e22d-4ded-9b6e-2ef388f4b056","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> print(d.get('name'))\nNone\n>>> d.get('name', 'N/A')\n'N/A'","collabId":"1484a892-5a82-4d09-859d-9c52d3749da1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"af223536-2233-42db-9ab4-50d83bb56ba8","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"items"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个包含所有字典项的列表，其中每个元素都为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"(key, value)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的形式。返回值属于一种名为字典视图的特殊类型。字典视图可用于迭代。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"bbb787fb-22cf-4b41-a63e-f11bb65d1113","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"864d80f8-1779-4754-9fb7-eb4f1ed512e1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {'title': 'Python Web Site', 'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'spam': 0}\n>>> d.items()\ndict_items([('url', 'http://www.python.org'), ('spam', 0), ('title', 'Python Web Site')])\n\n>>> it = d.items()\n>>> len(it)\n3\n>>> ('spam', 0) in it\nTrue","collabId":"37c8ace8-48e5-49e6-96a0-edf11803e15a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"a00aa7d1-232f-4897-9753-95f5426b6403","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3c147f9d-ffa8-4160-866a-19c692a12f9f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视图的一个优点是不复制，它们始终是底层字典的反映，即便你修改了底层字典亦如此。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3779feb1-e54b-4b95-80ce-233685f3f547","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keys"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个字典视图，其中包含指定字典中的键。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"fd038f7f-f316-4eac-ab63-f0834de02871","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e7f131cd-048d-4393-a86b-496f405d8e4e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {'x': 1, 'y': 2}\n>>> d.keys()\ndict_keys(['x', 'y'])","collabId":"909f076d-dbeb-4afa-a09b-4bf9b72a1321","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bb0e680e-eab9-4d24-95b4-d8cae492cddd","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"pop"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可用于获取与指定键相关联的值，并将该键-值对从字典中删除。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"73742cc2-e377-48c2-a520-58ffbdbfaf48","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"43d3c39a-a6ee-4b55-b085-1b8aa366c683","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {'x': 1, 'y': 2}\n>>> d.pop('x')\n1\n>>> d\n{'y': 2}","collabId":"87234aca-e4d6-4a38-8fe3-9d04b9319708","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2fe3b18b-63e4-42dd-9bd6-d78229549026","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"popitem"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类似于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list.pop"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"list.pop"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 弹出列表中的最后一个元素，而 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"popitem"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 随机地弹出一个字典项，因为字典项的顺序是不确定的，没有“最后一个元素”的概念。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"92a0f96f-b35e-4606-ab99-83a13528f736","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果你要以高效地方式"},{"type":"underline","color":"green","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"7e2ceef7-e694-406e-a06a-1a1739997ec1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"逐个删除并处理所有字典项"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这可能很有用，因为这样无需先获取键列表。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"4b9e4759-d133-4266-b513-1d6a57fadbaf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c6fe08b-c7ba-42f4-a2a5-20b5ba32c526","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'spam': 0, 'title': 'Python Web Site'}\n>>> d.popitem()\n('url', 'http://www.python.org')\n>>> d\n{'spam': 0, 'title': 'Python Web Site'}","collabId":"5fcbdb80-1f13-421e-a6a1-ba6486ed9dfc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91333745-5e5b-4169-833d-b497faba1116","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setdefault"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有点像 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因为它也获取与指定键相关联的值，但除此之外，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setdefault"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还在字典不包含指定的键时，在字典中添加指定的键-值对。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c65151c2-22b0-431a-b6da-0a49a1de635c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"指定的键不存在时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"setdefault"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回指定的值并相应地更新字典。如果指定的键存在，就返回其值，并保持字典不变。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"301e433d-455e-4931-89ee-d02d112c7138","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"get"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一样，值是可选的；如果没有指定，默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"None"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"1fc4252a-fc4b-40d2-bcf5-41a4dfbdba7d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"14ebb1e3-f1e0-4412-a7f9-32f4a9288a46","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d.setdefault('name', 'N/A')\n'N/A'\n>>> d\n{'name': 'N/A'}\n>>> d['name'] = 'Gumby'\n>>> d.setdefault('name', 'N/A')\n'Gumby'\n>>> d\n{'name': 'Gumby'}","collabId":"3cd00ce1-d17f-4333-b953-dcf66e347135","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"852dda98-42e3-4235-9e9d-221ea3a210bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"update"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使用一个字典中的项来更新另一个字典。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"51da81cf-0667-4ff5-9d96-3f6b16da7595","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"21a69afc-146e-4aa6-bf04-48e2d2fe250c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {'title': 'Python Web Site', 'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'changed': 'Mar 14 22:09:15 MET 2016'}\n>>> x = {'title': 'Python Language Website'}\n>>> d.update(x)\n>>> d\n{'url': 'http://www.python.org', 'changed': 'Mar 14 22:09:15 MET 2016', 'title': 'Python Language Website'}","collabId":"b1a16d59-c714-4698-984d-4d11e36da2d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0a7fc7b7-8bfc-491f-a63a-8faeca455504","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"values"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回一个由字典中的值组成的字典视图。不同于方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"keys"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"values"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 返回的视图"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"64f7e921-1f5a-4501-8623-c04bb5c2d615","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可能包含重复的值"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"5feda20a-06d8-4f3e-8a63-4b990f63c4f2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cd9083c3-f901-4f93-b2a7-d9d2752f0dfc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> d = {}\n>>> d[1] = 1\n>>> d[2] = 2\n>>> d[3] = 3\n>>> d[4] = 1\n>>> d.values()\ndict_values([1, 2, 3, 1])","collabId":"5effa5a0-eb22-43e0-860d-b36146c34e5c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python/字典"],"createTime":1719155509796,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}